				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2784fc07-0869-52fc-a263-d5b0d719249a")
	)
	(text "DRV8363 per SLVSHQ3 Table 7-1: CGVDD 10uF, CDVDD 1uF, CCPT_FLY 1uF, CVCP 1uF, RnFAULT 10k, CVREF 0.1uF, CVDRAIN 1uF, CBST 1uF"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40 50 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4ac58d12-8c97-57a2-bcad-ab7a29986fd1")
	)
	(text "3x PWM: INHx = PWM, INLx = enable (MOTOR_HIZ). DRVOFF high = outputs off: R49 pulls it to DVDD, Q8 pulls it low only while MOTOR_ENABLE is high (off on +3V loss, reset or unplugged logic). ASCIN pulled low; SPI_ASC_EN is the firmware path (D06)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40 56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8a4f001a-a318-55e5-9ca9-f2f6eecd7247")
	)
